WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.704
- So has he made you
change any diapers yet?

00:00:02.704 --> 00:00:06.257
(lighthearted music)

00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:08.463
- We are so excited to be
able to recommend Jackson

00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:10.715
for this reading program,
so if you just wanna go home

00:00:10.715 --> 00:00:13.363
and talk it over with your
husband and let us know.

00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:14.919
- I mean, I can let you know now.

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:16.404
I think it would be a great idea.

00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:17.451
- Uh, I mean, it's okay.

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:19.239
You can go home, talk it over.

00:00:19.239 --> 00:00:21.028
- So you're a stay-at-home mom now?

00:00:21.028 --> 00:00:21.774
- Yeah.

00:00:21.774 --> 00:00:23.631
- And you're totally okay with
your husband being the one

00:00:23.631 --> 00:00:25.628
who brings home the bacon?

00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:28.626
- Aw, look at you
pitching in doing laundry.

00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:30.162
So helpful.

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.903
- Oh, sorry, there's no changing table

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:33.064
in the women's restroom.

00:00:33.064 --> 00:00:33.902
- There isn't?

00:00:33.902 --> 00:00:36.063
- No, you can try across
the street, though.

00:00:37.339 --> 00:00:39.318
- Hi.
- [Woman] Hi, we're here.

00:00:39.318 --> 00:00:40.321
- [Man] She looks great.

00:00:40.321 --> 00:00:41.784
- [Woman] Oh, thank you.

00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:43.184
- Did Dad get her dressed?

00:00:43.184 --> 00:00:44.670
(children laughing)

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.928
- [Dark-Haired Girl] No,
don't throw it by me!

00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:47.897
(ball thuds)

00:00:47.897 --> 00:00:49.881
- I bet you can't wait
to get back to work.

00:00:49.881 --> 00:00:51.088
- Uh-oh, looks like someone

00:00:51.088 --> 00:00:52.737
got stuck babysitting this weekend.

00:00:52.737 --> 00:00:54.064
- Well, I'm not getting paid,

00:00:54.064 --> 00:00:56.176
so I think it's just parenting.

00:00:56.176 --> 00:00:59.314
- [Woman in Stripes]
(growls) I'm a dinosaur.

00:00:59.314 --> 00:01:00.961
(children shriek)

00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:04.726
(woman yells)
(children laugh)

00:01:04.726 --> 00:01:07.152
- Don't let your girlfriends
see you acting like this.

00:01:07.152 --> 00:01:07.875
- Hi.

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:08.478
- Hi.

00:01:08.478 --> 00:01:10.037
- There a reason you're
at the playground today?

00:01:10.037 --> 00:01:11.922
- Yeah, I'm here with my kid.

00:01:11.922 --> 00:01:12.947
- Yeah, which one?

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.083
- The one right over there
in the No Fear shirt.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:15.946
- What's his name?

00:01:15.946 --> 00:01:17.153
- Jackson.

00:01:17.153 --> 00:01:19.736
- Hey, Jackson, is this your mom?

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.063
- [Woman] Are you okay?

00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:22.946
Did you get an owie?

00:01:22.946 --> 00:01:24.154
Let me see.
- [Man] Aw, sweetie.

00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:25.109
- [Woman] Can I give it a kiss?

00:01:25.109 --> 00:01:26.595
- I'll go get your husband, okay.

00:01:26.595 --> 00:01:28.568
I'll get him up here in just a sec.

00:01:28.568 --> 00:01:31.033
They always want their daddy.

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:33.940
- Nah. (laughs)

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:38.398
(lighthearted music)

